) &amp; First(Fields!txtSchoolLogoPath.Value, "SchoolLogo")</Value><Sizing>FitProportional</Sizing><Left>25.6cm</Left><Height>1.4cm</Height><Width>3.1cm</Width><ZIndex>1</ZIndex><Style><Border><Style>None</Style></Border></Style></Image><Image Name="Image1"><Source>Embedded</Source><Value>iSAMSLine</Value><Sizing>FitProportional</Sizing><Top>1.5cm</Top><Height>0.2cm</Height><Width>28.7cm</Width><ZIndex>2</ZIndex><Style><Border><Style>None</Style></Border></Style></Image></ReportItems><Style><Border><Style>None</Style></Border></Style></PageHeader><PageHeight>21cm</PageHeight><PageWidth>29.7cm</PageWidth><LeftMargin>0.5cm</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0.5cm</RightMargin><TopMargin>0.5cm</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0.5cm</BottomMargin><ColumnSpacing>0.13cm</ColumnSpacing><Style /></Page></ReportSection></ReportSections><EmbeddedImages><EmbeddedImage Name="iSAMSLine"><MIMEType>image/png</MIMEType><ImageData></ImageData></EmbeddedImage></EmbeddedImages><rd:ReportUnitType>Cm</rd:ReportUnitType><rd:ReportID>c960c2c6-cf3e-4034-afcc-df5007f1bf06</rd:ReportID></Report>